# Drag source (bmuStartDrag), clipboard reads in any MIME type (bmuGetClipboardData), the copy/move intent of a
# drop from another bmu app (bmuDropAction, carried as application/x-bmu-drag-action), own drops served from
# memory, file-only selections kept, clipboard ownership (bmuClipboardOwned), data-offer reads that give up after
# 0.5 s without data (an unresponsive owner used to hang the app) and never ask for formats the owner doesn't
